rcing10-revised-countable-support.md\">../batch04/58-df-zfc-forcing10-revised-countable-support.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RevisedCountableSupport}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{RevisedCountableSupport}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (alias defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}revised\\text{-}countable\\text{-}support} \\vdash \\mathrm{RevisedCountableSupport}_S(p,\\delta)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcForcing10RevisedCountableSupport}_S(p,\\delta)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}revised\\text{-}countable\\text{-}support} \\vdash \\mathrm{RevisedCountableSupport}_S(p,\\delta)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcForcing10RevisedCountableSupport}_S(p,\\delta)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The upstream forcing predicate includes both countable support and the revision clause at support-limit stages; merely requiring countable initial segments does not capture RCS.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-zfc-forcing10-revised-countable-support.md","status":"resolved","id":"af389c83081b5b62","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-forcing10-revised-countable-support.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-zfc-forcing10-revised-countable-support.md","status":"resolved","id":"af389c83081b5b62","an